            "review_title": "Review at Lau De Truong Dinh",
            "review_text": "Andrea D\nBradford, United Kingdom54 contributions\n0\nDelicious\nApr 2024 • Couples\nExcellent food. I've tried goat in the UK in either Indian or Carribbean food and not particularly enjoyed it however this was a completely different experience. We shared goat curry, goat fillet with lime sauce and vegetables with noodles. We ordered the smaller portion of each - there was a lot of food! It was our first time trying fresh lemon soda with salt - highly recommended.\n\nWe also inadvertently got involved in a young boys birthday party 🎈🎈🎈and were made to feel very welcome.\n\nStaff were very friendly and helpful.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIt wasn't obvious until we went in but the only meat on the menu is goat.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
