            "review_title": "Review at Lau De Truong Dinh",
            "review_text": "Amie B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam48 contributions\n0\nAuthentic local favorite\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI've been going to this lovely restaurant for 6 years now. It's a local favorite as they all trust the food to be clean and safe. The BBQ and hot pot never disappoint. Sometime service on the first floor is a bit slow. But seating on the second floor always has good service and is a bit more open. Try the the goi de Chanh - lemon goat salad. It's sour and the meat is very tender.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 4, 2016",
