            "review_text": "Chris P\nLondon, United Kingdom27 contributions\n0\nBrilliant do it yourself hotpot, Vietnam-style\nApr 2015\nThis looks a fairly nondescript place but my wife and I were staying nearby and thought we'd try it on the off chance. We weren't disappointed.friendly people and fresh ingredients.decent cold beer, too. Good sign? It was packed with locals. Go there.\nWritten February 10, 2016",
